flowchart TB
    subgraph VERIFY[Verify Explicitly]
        V1[User + agent<br/>authentication] --> V2[Conditional access<br/>device + session]
        V2 --> V3[Step-up auth for<br/>privileged approvals]
    end
    subgraph LP[Least Privilege]
        L1[Separate read /<br/>write identities] --> L2[Enumerated<br/>connector scopes]
        L2 --> L3[Short-lived<br/>credentials]
    end
    subgraph AB[Assume Breach]
        B1[Retrieved content<br/>= untrusted input] --> B2[Injection defenses<br/>+ segmentation]
        B2 --> B3[Kill switch<br/>tested per tier]
    end
    VERIFY --> AGENT[AI Agent<br/>nonhuman identity]
    LP --> AGENT
    AB --> AGENT
    AGENT --> LOG[Full-path logging<br/>to SIEM]
